        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    nominal_return = 0.08\n    tax_rate = 0.20\n    inflation_rate = 0.025\n\n    after_tax_return = nominal_return * (1 - tax_rate)\n    real_return = (1 + after_tax_return) / (1 + inflation_rate) - 1\n    answer = round(real_return * 100, 2)\n\n    return answer\n```",
